# Cloudflare Pages Headers Configuration
# Documentation: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/

# Prevent search engines from indexing the default *.pages.dev subdomain
https://ajeet090-yamltojson.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# Security & performance headers for all routes
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
